msgid "Calculator"
msgstr "ᱠᱮᱞᱠᱩᱞᱮᱴᱟᱨ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.desktop.in:3
#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Perform arithmetic, scientific or financial calculations"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ, ᱵᱤᱜᱽᱭᱟᱱᱤᱠ ᱵᱟᱝᱠᱷᱟᱱ ᱠᱟᱹᱣᱰᱤ ᱞᱮᱠᱷᱟ ᱠᱚᱨᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.desktop.in:5
msgid "calculation;arithmetic;scientific;financial;"
msgstr "ᱞᱮᱠᱷᱟ; ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ; ᱵᱤᱜᱽᱭᱟᱱᱤᱠ; ᱠᱟᱹᱣᱰᱤ;"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Calculator is an application that solves mathematical equations. Though it "
"at first appears to be a simple calculator with only basic arithmetic "
"operations, you can switch into Advanced, Financial, or Programming mode to "
"find a surprising set of capabilities."
msgstr ""
"ᱠᱮᱞᱠᱩᱞᱮᱴᱟᱨ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱤᱫ ᱮᱯᱞᱤᱠᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱫᱚ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱥᱚᱢᱟᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱚᱞᱦᱮᱭᱟ ᱾ ᱡᱩᱫᱤ "
"ᱯᱩᱭᱞᱩ ᱨᱮ ᱱᱚᱶᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱮᱠᱮᱱ ᱢᱩᱲᱩᱫ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱠᱟᱹᱢᱤ ᱥᱟᱶᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱫᱷᱟᱨᱚᱱ ᱠᱮᱞᱠᱩᱞᱮᱴᱚᱨ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱧᱮᱞᱚᱜ "
"ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱟᱢ ᱫᱚ ᱮᱰᱵᱷᱟᱱᱥ, ᱯᱷᱟᱭᱤᱱᱥᱤᱭᱟᱞ, ᱥᱮ ᱯᱨᱚᱜᱽᱨᱟᱢᱤᱝ ᱢᱚᱰ ᱨᱮ ᱵᱚᱫᱚᱞ ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱦᱟᱦᱟᱲᱟ ᱥᱮᱴ "
"ᱧᱟᱢ ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜ-ᱟ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"The Advanced calculator supports many operations, including: logarithms, "
"factorials, trigonometric and hyperbolic functions, modulus division, "
"complex numbers, random number generation and prime factorization."
msgstr ""
"ᱩᱛᱟᱹᱨ ᱠᱮᱞᱠᱩᱞᱮᱴᱚᱨ ᱟᱭᱢᱟ ᱚᱯᱟᱨᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱥᱟᱯᱚᱨᱴ ᱮᱫᱟᱭ, ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱨᱮ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜᱼᱟ: ᱞᱚᱜᱚᱨᱤᱰᱚᱢ, "
"ᱯᱷᱮᱠᱴᱚᱨᱤᱭᱟᱞ, ᱴᱨᱟᱭᱜᱚᱱᱚᱢᱮᱴᱨᱤᱠ ᱟᱨ ᱦᱟᱭᱯᱟᱨᱵᱚᱞᱤᱠ ᱯᱷᱟᱱᱥᱚᱱ, ᱢᱳᱰᱩᱞᱟᱥ ᱦᱟᱹᱴᱤᱧ, ᱦᱟᱨᱚᱱ "
"ᱮᱞ, ᱨᱮᱱᱰᱚᱢ ᱮᱞ ᱥᱤᱨᱡᱟᱹᱣ ᱟᱨ ᱯᱨᱟᱭᱤᱢ ᱯᱷᱮᱠᱴᱚᱨᱟᱭᱡᱮᱥᱚᱱ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"Financial mode supports several computations, including periodic interest "
"rate, present and future value, double declining and straight line "
"depreciation, and many others."
msgstr ""
"ᱠᱟᱹᱣᱰᱤ ᱢᱚᱰ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱭᱢᱟ ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱟᱯᱚᱨᱴ ᱮᱫᱟ, ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱨᱮ ᱚᱠᱛᱚ ᱥᱩᱛ ᱫᱚᱨ, ᱱᱟᱦᱟᱜ ᱟᱨ ᱟᱜᱟᱢ "
"ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ, ᱵᱟᱨ ᱫᱷᱟᱣ ᱠᱚᱢᱚᱜ ᱟᱨ ᱥᱚᱡᱷᱮ ᱞᱟᱭᱤᱱ ᱰᱤᱯᱨᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱟᱨ ᱟᱭᱢᱟ ᱮᱴᱟᱜ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ-ᱟ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:27
msgid ""
"Programming mode supports calculations using common bases (binary, octal, "
"decimal, and hexadecimal), bitwise operations, two’s complement, character "
"to character code conversion, and more."
msgstr ""
"ᱯᱨᱚᱜᱽᱨᱟᱢᱤᱝ ᱢᱚᱰ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱫᱷᱟᱨᱚᱱ ᱵᱮᱥ (ᱵᱟᱭᱱᱟᱨᱤ, ᱚᱠᱴᱟᱞ, ᱰᱮᱥᱤᱢᱟᱞ, ᱟᱨ ᱦᱮᱠᱥᱟᱰᱮᱥᱤᱢᱟᱞ), "
"ᱵᱤᱴᱣᱟᱭᱤᱡᱽ ᱚᱯᱟᱨᱮᱥᱚᱱ, ᱵᱟᱨ ᱯᱩᱨᱟᱹᱣ, ᱪᱤᱠᱤ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱪᱤᱠᱤ ᱠᱚᱰ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱟᱨ ᱟᱭᱢᱟ ᱠᱚ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨ "
"ᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱞᱮᱠᱷᱟ ᱥᱟᱯᱚᱨᱴ ᱮᱫᱟᱭ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:32
msgid ""
"Conversion mode supports conversions between common units, currencies and "
"number bases."
msgstr ""
"ᱨᱚᱲ ᱢᱚᱰ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱫᱷᱟᱨᱚᱱ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ, ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱟᱨ ᱮᱞᱮᱞ ᱟᱫᱷᱟᱨ ᱠᱚ ᱛᱟᱞᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱨᱚᱲ ᱥᱟᱯᱚᱨᱴ ᱮᱢᱚᱜ "
"ᱠᱟᱱᱟ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid "Basic Mode"
msgstr "ᱢᱩᱲᱩᱫ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:47
msgid "Advanced Mode"
msgstr "ᱮᱰᱵᱷᱟᱱᱥ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:51
msgid "Financial Mode"
msgstr "ᱯᱷᱟᱭᱱᱟᱱᱥᱤᱭᱟᱞ ᱢᱳᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:55
msgid "Programming Mode"
msgstr "ᱯᱨᱚᱜᱨᱟᱢᱤᱝ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:59
msgid "Keyboard Mode"
msgstr "ᱠᱤᱵᱳᱨᱰ ᱢᱳᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid "Conversion Mode"
msgstr "ᱨᱚᱲ ᱵᱚᱫᱚᱞ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#. developer_name tag deprecated with Appstream 1.0
#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:84
#: data/org.gnome.Calculator.metainfo.xml.in:86 src/gnome-calculator.vala:308
msgid "The GNOME Project"
msgstr "GNOME ᱯᱟᱱᱛᱷᱟ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:32
msgid "Persistent history tape"
msgstr "ᱛᱷᱤᱨ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱱ ᱱᱟᱜᱟᱢ ᱴᱮᱯ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:33
msgid ""
"History entries saved across sessions as (equation, answer) pairs. Written "
"on window close. Cleared when the user clears history."
msgstr ""
"ᱱᱟᱜᱟᱢ ᱵᱚᱞᱚᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱫᱚ ᱥᱟᱱᱟᱢ ᱫᱷᱚᱱ ᱨᱮ (ᱥᱚᱢᱟᱱ, ᱛᱮᱞᱟ) ᱡᱚᱲ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱥᱟᱧᱪᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ᱾ "
"ᱡᱷᱚᱨᱠᱟ ᱵᱚᱱᱫᱚ ᱨᱮ ᱚᱞ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱾ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨᱤᱭᱟᱹ ᱠᱚ ᱱᱟᱜᱟᱢ ᱠᱚ ᱯᱷᱟᱨᱪᱟ ᱠᱷᱟᱱ ᱯᱷᱟᱨᱪᱟᱜᱼᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:41
msgid "Accuracy value"
msgstr "ᱴᱷᱤᱠ ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:42
msgid "The number of digits displayed after the numeric point"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱯᱚᱭᱮᱱᱴ ᱛᱟᱭᱚᱢ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱮᱞ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:47
msgid "Word size"
msgstr "ᱟᱹᱲᱟᱹ ᱜᱚᱲᱦᱚᱱ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:48
msgid "The size of the words used in bitwise operations"
msgstr "ᱵᱤᱴᱣᱟᱭᱤᱡᱽ ᱚᱯᱟᱨᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱨᱮ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱ ᱟᱹᱲᱟᱹ ᱠᱚ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱜᱚᱲᱦᱚᱱ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:53
msgid "Numeric base"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱵᱮᱥ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:54
msgid "The numeric base"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱵᱮᱥ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:58
msgid "Group digits"
msgstr "ᱜᱟᱫᱮᱞ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:59
msgid "Indicates whether digits are grouped in large numbers."
msgstr "ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱮᱢᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱡᱮ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱮᱞ ᱨᱮ ᱜᱟᱫᱮᱞ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱥᱮ ᱵᱟᱝᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:63
msgid "Show trailing zeroes"
msgstr "ᱛᱟᱭᱚᱢ ᱨᱮ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱥᱩᱱ ᱠᱚ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱢᱮ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:64
msgid ""
"Indicates whether any trailing zeroes after the numeric point should be "
"shown in the display value."
msgstr ""
"ᱩᱫᱩᱜᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱡᱮ ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱯᱚᱭᱮᱱᱴ ᱛᱟᱭᱚᱢ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱱ ᱛᱟᱭᱚᱢ ᱥᱩᱱ ᱫᱚ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ ᱨᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜᱚᱜ "
"ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤᱭᱟ ᱥᱮ ᱵᱟᱝᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:68
msgid "Number format"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱮᱞ ᱨᱩᱯ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:69
msgid "The format to display numbers in"
msgstr "ᱮᱞᱠᱷᱟ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱯᱨᱚᱨᱩᱢ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:73
msgid "Angle units"
msgstr "ᱮᱝᱜᱽᱞ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:74
msgid "The angle units to use"
msgstr "ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱮᱝᱜᱽᱞ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:78
msgid "Currency update interval"
msgstr "ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱟᱯᱰᱮᱴ ᱤᱱᱴᱟᱨᱵᱷᱟᱞ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:79
msgid ""
"How often the currency exchange rates should be updated. A value of 0 means "
"the currency exchange rates won't be fetched from the network at all."
msgstr ""
"ᱛᱤᱱᱟᱹᱜ ᱫᱷᱟᱣ ᱯᱩᱭᱥᱟᱹ ᱵᱚᱫᱚᱞ ᱫᱚᱨ ᱟᱯᱰᱮᱴ ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤᱭᱟ᱾ ᱐ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱢᱮᱱᱮᱛ ᱫᱚ ᱯᱩᱭᱥᱟᱹ "
"ᱵᱚᱫᱚᱞ ᱫᱚᱨ ᱫᱚ ᱱᱮᱴᱣᱟᱨᱠ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱟᱹᱜᱩᱜᱼᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:83
msgid "Currency display"
msgstr "ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:84
msgid ""
"Indicates whether to show currency code, currency name or both of them in "
"the converter."
msgstr ""
"ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱮᱢᱚᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱡᱮ ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱠᱚᱰ, ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱥᱮ ᱵᱟᱱᱟᱨ ᱜᱮ ᱠᱚᱱᱵᱷᱟᱨᱴᱟᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ "
"ᱦᱩᱭᱩᱜᱼᱟ ᱥᱮ ᱵᱟᱝᱟ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:88
msgid "Enabled completions"
msgstr "ᱪᱟᱹᱞᱩ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱢᱩᱪᱟᱹᱫ ᱠᱚ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:89
msgid ""
"The types of completion proposals to be shown in the auto-completion list."
msgstr "ᱯᱩᱨᱟᱹᱣ ᱯᱨᱚᱥᱛᱟᱥ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱞᱮᱠᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱟᱡ ᱛᱮ ᱯᱩᱨᱟᱹᱣ ᱛᱟᱞᱠᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜᱚᱜᱼᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:93
msgid "Favorite currencies"
msgstr "ᱠᱩᱥᱤ ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:94
msgid "The favorite currencies to be shown at the top of the currency list."
msgstr "ᱠᱩᱥᱤᱭᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱠᱚ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱟᱨᱟᱱᱥᱤ ᱛᱟᱞᱠᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱪᱮᱛᱟᱱ ᱨᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜᱚᱜᱼᱟ ᱾"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:98
msgid "Button mode"
msgstr "ᱵᱩᱛᱟᱢ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:99
msgid "The button mode"
msgstr "ᱵᱩᱛᱟᱢ ᱢᱚᱰ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:103
msgid "Unit category"
msgstr "ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ ᱛᱷᱚᱠ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:104
msgid "Currently selected unit category in the converter"
msgstr "ᱱᱤᱛᱚᱜ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱚᱱᱵᱷᱟᱨᱴᱟᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ ᱛᱷᱚᱠ ᱵᱟᱪᱷᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:108
msgid "Source units"
msgstr "ᱥᱚᱨᱥ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:109
msgid "Currently selected source units in the converter"
msgstr "ᱱᱤᱛᱚᱜ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱚᱱᱵᱷᱟᱨᱴᱟᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱵᱟᱪᱷᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱥᱚᱨᱥ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ ᱠᱚ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:113
msgid "Target units"
msgstr "ᱴᱟᱨᱜᱮᱴ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:114
msgid "Currently selected target units in the converter"
msgstr "ᱱᱤᱛᱚᱜ ᱫᱚ ᱠᱚᱱᱵᱷᱟᱨᱴᱟᱨ ᱨᱮ ᱵᱟᱪᱷᱟᱣ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱴᱟᱨᱜᱮᱴ ᱭᱩᱱᱤᱴ ᱠᱚ"

#: data/org.gnome.calculator.gschema.xml:118
