#: lib/number.vala:1100
msgid "Inverse tangent is undefined for values i and -i"
msgstr "ᱩᱞᱴᱟᱹ ᱴᱮᱱᱡᱮᱱᱴ ᱫᱚ ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ ᱠᱚ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱩᱱᱩᱨᱩᱢ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ i ᱟᱨ -i"

#. Translators: Error displayed when inverse hyperbolic cosine value is undefined
#: lib/number.vala:1151
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic cosine is undefined for values less than one"
msgstr ""
"ᱩᱞᱴᱟᱹ ᱦᱟᱭᱯᱟᱨᱵᱚᱞᱤᱠ ᱠᱚᱥᱟᱭᱤᱱ ᱫᱚ ᱢᱤᱫ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱠᱚᱢ ᱜᱚᱱᱚᱝ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱵᱟᱝ ᱩᱱᱩᱨᱩᱢ ᱟᱠᱟᱱᱟ"

#. Translators: Error displayed when inverse hyperbolic tangent value is undefined
#: lib/number.vala:1167
msgid "Inverse hyperbolic tangent is undefined for values outside [-1, 1]"
